    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if your worst nightmares didn\u2019t end when you opened your eyes?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the sudden loss of his wife, Steve is consumed by insomnia. Days blur into nights as reality begins to unravel around him. Haunted by twisted visions and shadowy figures, he finds himself trapped in a waking nightmare where nothing is as it seems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waking Dreams</strong> is a psychological survival horror game that blends atmospheric exploration, intense suspense, resource management and combat. Navigate threatening\u00a0environments, solve puzzles, and piece together the truth behind Steve\u2019s fractured mind. As he confronts the darkest corners of his past, the line between dream and reality begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/b3825d621d8f8fe4a10ebb49ee244344.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if your worst nightmares didn\u2019t end when you opened your eyes?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the sudden loss of his wife, Steve is consumed by insomnia. Days blur into nights as reality begins to unravel around him. Haunted by twisted visions and shadowy figures, he finds himself trapped in a waking nightmare where nothing is as it seems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/ca33ec793316c6015e71f65085e2673c.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waking Dreams</strong> is a psychological survival horror game that blends atmospheric exploration, intense suspense, resource management and combat. Navigate threatening\u00a0environments, solve puzzles, and piece together the truth behind Steve\u2019s fractured mind. As he confronts the darkest corners of his past, the line between dream and reality begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.poster.avif?t=1752557288\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.webm?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800670/extras/cdea97768c6c37a2cf0e46a3def536df.mp4?t=1752557288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
